		"Id": "chassisdef_archer_ARC-9W",
		"Name": "Archer",
		"Details": "Developed for the Word of Blake's Protectorate Militia as a high end fire support and direct combat mech.  The Archer 9W saw limited deployment with other WoB units and several were captured and used by both Cameron and ComStar forces.  Centered on twin ER Large lasers, and XL350 engine core, and two 15 tube Artemis IV Launchers with 3 tons of CASEed Ammunition, this Archer variant was well armed.   However the key to this mech was actually its protection schema.  Gone was C3i, and in it's steed, an Angel ECM suite and VOID Signature system.   Void Signature system is basically WoB Battle Armor/infantry Mimetic system scaled up into a Battlemech armor.   It falls somewhere between Stealth Armor and a dedicated Null-Signature system with Chameleon Light Polarization system.  Used in this Archer provides ambush opportunities to what is otherwise a large blocky robot easy to see on the battlefield.",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_archer"
	},
